       "en": "They came from there yesterday."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "lines": [
      {
       "cyr": "Твојта мајка колак месе,",
       "lat": "Tvojta majka kolak mese,",
       "en": "Your mother is making a wedding bread"
      },
      {
